('web','I do not browse automatically. The Wikipedia reader handles one requested summary at a time.', ['do you browse the web','do you crawl the internet','can you search everything','are you learning from the internet now','do you read websites by yourself','are you crawling websites','do you automatically read wikipedia','can you browse on your own','are you browsing the internet','do you crawl the web automatically']),
