('update','A matching kernel update replaces kernel8.img. Reflashing a full image resets saved data.', ['how do i update you','will an update erase memory','do i need to reflash','can i update without losing memories','how do kernel updates work','how do i install an update','will reflashing erase my facts','can i keep memories when updating','how can i update you','can updates keep my memories']),
